Reason: Allow modules to supply final melee/ranged and spell crit without stat-derived WoW feedback.

Constant (audit 232, 95.0f): Native configured critical-chance ceiling default; Unchanged upstream fallback; hook can override afterward. Keep in native config, not a second DC tunable.

